{"seq":3,"slug":"webhook-security-verification","title":"Webhook 安全与签名验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals/webhook-security-verification","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"webhook-安全与签名验证\">Webhook 安全与签名验证</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Webhook 安全的核心挑战是在开放网络上验证发送方身份——HTTPS 保护传输层，但无法证明请求来自声称的 provider。本文覆盖 HMAC-SHA256 签名机制、Standard Webhooks 三头规范、时间戳防重放、常量时间比较、secret 轮换、IETF SWT 草案、端点验证与传输层加固。</p>\n<h2 id=\"威胁模型\">威胁模型</h2><p>Webhook 的安全挑战来自通信模型的特殊性：provider 向消费者的公网端点发送 POST 请求。这条链路面临四类攻击：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>威胁</th>\n<th>攻击方式</th>\n<th>危害</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>伪造（Spoofing）</td>\n<td>攻击者伪装成 provider 向消费者端点发送恶意 payload</td>\n<td>消费者执行非预期操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>篡改（Tampering）</td>\n<td>中间人修改传输中的 payload</td>\n<td>数据完整性被破坏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重放（Replay）</td>\n<td>截获合法请求后重新发送</td>\n<td>重复处理导致资金损失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信息泄露</td>\n<td>Webhook URL 被发现后被探测</td>\n<td>暴露业务事件流</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>HTTPS/TLS 解决传输层加密，但无法证明<strong>发送者身份</strong>——任何知道消费者 URL 的人都可以发送请求。HMAC 签名验证填补了这个缺口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hmac-sha256-签名机制\">HMAC-SHA256 签名机制</h2><p>HMAC（Hash-based Message Authentication Code）是 webhook 安全的行业标准。其核心思想：provider 和消费者共享一个 secret，provider 用 secret 对 payload 计算哈希，消费者用相同 secret 重新计算并比对。</p>\n<p>签名计算公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>signature</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>Base64</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mtext>HMAC-SHA256</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>m</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\">∥</mo><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\">∥</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{signature} = \\text{Base64}\\left(\\text{HMAC-SHA256}(secret,\\ msg\\_id \\mathbin{\\|} timestamp \\mathbin{\\|} body)\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">signature</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Base64</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HMAC-SHA256</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">secr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">im</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">am</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\">∥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbin{\\|}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span></span></span></span></span></span> 表示用 <code>.</code> 拼接。待签名字符串包含三个部分确保了：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>msg_id</strong> — 绑定到特定事件，防止签名被用于其他事件</li>\n<li><strong>timestamp</strong> — 时间绑定，限制签名有效期</li>\n<li><strong>body</strong> — 内容绑定，防止 payload 被篡改</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"standard-webhooks-签名规范\">Standard Webhooks 签名规范</h2><p>Standard Webhooks 规范（2023 发起，2026 年已被 100+ SaaS 采纳）统一了签名实现：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"签名输入: &quot;{webhook-id}.{webhook-timestamp}.{raw-body}&quot;&#10;算法: HMAC-SHA256&#10;输出格式: &quot;v1,&quot; + base64(signature)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>签名输入: \"{webhook-id}.{webhook-timestamp}.{raw-body}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>算法: HMAC-SHA256</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出格式: \"v1,\" + base64(signature)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个 HTTP 头构成完整的安全信封：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>头</th>\n<th>示例值</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>webhook-id</code></td>\n<td><code>msg_2kx9mR7vLq</code></td>\n<td>事件唯一标识</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>webhook-timestamp</code></td>\n<td><code>1721296200</code></td>\n<td>Unix 秒级时间戳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>webhook-signature</code></td>\n<td><code>v1,K7rD...base64...==</code></td>\n<td>签名值（支持多值用空格分隔）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>v1</code> 前缀允许未来升级签名算法而不破坏现有验证器。多签名值支持 secret 轮换期间的过渡。</p>\n<h3 id=\"验证流程-node-js-实现\">验证流程（Node.js 实现）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"import { createHmac, timingSafeEqual } from &#39;node:crypto&#39;;&#10;&#10;const TOLERANCE_SECONDS = 300; // 5 分钟容忍窗口&#10;&#10;function verifyStandardWebhook(rawBody, headers, secret) {&#10;  const msgId = headers[&#39;webhook-id&#39;];&#10;  const timestamp = headers[&#39;webhook-timestamp&#39;];&#10;  const signatures = headers[&#39;webhook-signature&#39;];&#10;&#10;  // 步骤 1: 时间戳验证（防重放）&#10;  const now = Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000);&#10;  if (Math.abs(now - parseInt(timestamp)) &gt; TOLERANCE_SECONDS) {&#10;    throw new Error(&#39;Timestamp outside tolerance window&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 步骤 2: 重新计算签名&#10;  const toSign = `${msgId}.${timestamp}.${rawBody}`;&#10;  const expected = createHmac(&#39;sha256&#39;, secret).update(toSign).digest(&#39;base64&#39;);&#10;&#10;  // 步骤 3: 常量时间比较（防时序攻击）&#10;  for (const sig of signatures.split(&#39; &#39;)) {&#10;    const [version, value] = sig.split(&#39;,&#39;);&#10;    if (version !== &#39;v1&#39;) continue;&#10;    const a = Buffer.from(expected);&#10;    const b = Buffer.from(value);&#10;    if (a.length === b.length &amp;&amp; timingSafeEqual(a, b)) {&#10;      return true;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;  throw new Error(&#39;Invalid signature&#39;);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { createHmac, timingSafeEqual } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:crypto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TOLERANCE_SECONDS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 300</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 5 分钟容忍窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> verifyStandardWebhook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">rawBody</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">secret</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> msgId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'webhook-id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'webhook-timestamp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> signatures</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> headers[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'webhook-signature'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 步骤 1: 时间戳验证（防重放）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parseInt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(timestamp)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> TOLERANCE_SECONDS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Timestamp outside tolerance window'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 步骤 2: 重新计算签名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> toSign</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">msgId</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">timestamp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}.${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">rawBody</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> expected</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createHmac</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sha256'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, secret).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(toSign).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">digest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'base64'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 步骤 3: 常量时间比较（防时序攻击）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sig</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> signatures.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sig.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">split</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">','</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'v1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">continue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expected);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Buffer.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (a.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> timingSafeEqual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a, b)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Invalid signature'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"时间戳验证与防重放\">时间戳验证与防重放</h2><p>时间戳验证通过拒绝过期请求来防御重放攻击。典型容忍窗口为 <strong>5 分钟</strong>——足够覆盖网络延迟和时钟偏移，同时限制了截获请求的可利用时间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as 攻击者&#10;    participant P as Provider&#10;    participant C as 消费者&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;C: POST (timestamp=T₀, sig=S₁)&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;P: 200 OK&#10;    Note over A: 截获请求&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;C: POST (timestamp=T₀, sig=S₁)&#10;    Note over C: |T_now - T₀| &gt; 300s&#10;    C--&gt;&gt;A: 401 Timestamp expired\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as 攻击者\n    participant P as Provider\n    participant C as 消费者\n    P-&gt;&gt;C: POST (timestamp=T₀, sig=S₁)\n    C--&gt;&gt;P: 200 OK\n    Note over A: 截获请求\n    A-&gt;&gt;C: POST (timestamp=T₀, sig=S₁)\n    Note over C: |T_now - T₀| &gt; 300s\n    C--&gt;&gt;A: 401 Timestamp expired</pre><p>注意：时间戳验证依赖消费者服务器时钟的准确性。生产环境必须配置 NTP 同步，时钟偏移超过容忍窗口会导致合法请求被拒绝。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常量时间比较\">常量时间比较</h2><p>签名比较<strong>必须使用常量时间算法</strong>。普通字符串比较（<code>===</code>）在第一个不匹配字符处短路返回，攻击者可通过测量响应时间逐字节破解签名：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>response</mtext></msub><mo>∝</mo><mtext>匹配前缀长度</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{response}} \\propto \\text{匹配前缀长度}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">response</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">匹配前缀长度</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>所有语言的标准库都提供常量时间比较函数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>语言</th>\n<th>函数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Node.js</td>\n<td><code>crypto.timingSafeEqual()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td><code>hmac.compare_digest()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Go</td>\n<td><code>hmac.Equal()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Java</td>\n<td><code>MessageDigest.isEqual()</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"secret-管理与轮换\">Secret 管理与轮换</h2><p>Webhook signing secret 的生命周期管理是安全运维的核心：</p>\n<p><strong>生成</strong>：secret 应为高熵随机值，至少 32 字节（256 bit）。Standard Webhooks 推荐使用 <code>whsec_</code> 前缀标识用途：<code>whsec_MfKQ9r8GKYqrTwjUPD8ILPZIo2LaLaSw</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>存储</strong>：消费者侧加密存储 secret（如 AWS Secrets Manager、HashiCorp Vault），绝不以明文写入配置文件或代码仓库。</p>\n<p><strong>轮换</strong>：密钥轮换期间，provider 应同时用新旧 secret 计算签名（空格分隔多个签名值），消费者接受任一匹配即可：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"webhook-signature: v1,&lt;新签名&gt; v1,&lt;旧签名&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>webhook-signature: v1,&#x3C;新签名> v1,&#x3C;旧签名></span></span></code></pre></div><p>轮换窗口通常为 24-72 小时，确保所有消费者有充足时间更新本地 secret。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ietf-secure-webhook-token-swt-草案\">IETF Secure Webhook Token（SWT）草案</h2><p>2026 年 5 月，IETF 发布了 <code>draft-knauer-secure-webhook-token-02</code>，提出基于 JWT 的 webhook 安全方案。SWT 将事件元数据编码为 JWT claims，支持非对称签名（RSA/ECDSA），适用于不想共享对称密钥的场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>HMAC（Standard Webhooks）</th>\n<th>SWT（JWT-based）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>密钥类型</td>\n<td>对称（共享 secret）</td>\n<td>非对称（公/私钥对）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>验证方式</td>\n<td>消费者需持有 secret</td>\n<td>消费者只需公钥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 大小</td>\n<td>仅 HTTP 头（~100 bytes）</td>\n<td>JWT 体积较大（~500 bytes）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标准化程度</td>\n<td>100+ SaaS 已采纳</td>\n<td>IETF 草案阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>通用 webhook</td>\n<td>零信任/多方验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>SWT 在 <code>webhook</code> claim 中封装事件类型等元数据，并通过 <code>bdy</code> claim 绑定 request body 哈希，兼顾了 JWT 生态的工具兼容性和 webhook 场景的安全需求。</p>\n<h2 id=\"端点验证-abuse-protection\">端点验证（Abuse Protection）</h2><p>Provider 在注册阶段应验证消费者确实拥有该 URL 的控制权，防止：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>将 webhook 投递用作 DDoS 放大器（向受害者 URL 注册大量事件）</li>\n<li>向内网地址投递引发 SSRF</li>\n</ul>\n<p>CloudEvents 规范定义的验证协议：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Provider 向注册 URL 发送 <code>OPTIONS</code> 请求，携带 <code>WebHook-Request-Origin</code> 头</li>\n<li>消费者响应 <code>WebHook-Allowed-Origin</code> 头确认允许</li>\n<li>验证通过后 provider 才开始投递事件</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Svix 还内置了对内网 IP 段的默认阻断（SSRF 缓解），防止 webhook 被滥用为内网探测工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"传输层安全最佳实践\">传输层安全最佳实践</h2><p>签名验证之外，还需加固传输层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>强制 HTTPS</strong> — 拒绝 HTTP 端点注册</li>\n<li><strong>验证 TLS 证书</strong> — provider 投递时校验消费者证书链（防止 MITM）</li>\n<li><strong>mTLS（可选）</strong> — 高安全场景下消费者也向 provider 出示证书</li>\n<li><strong>IP 白名单</strong> — provider 公布投递源 IP 段，消费者在防火墙层过滤</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些措施与 HMAC 签名构成纵深防御——即使一层被突破，其他层仍能提供保护。深入了解 provider 侧如何设计安全的事件目录，参见 <a href=\"../provider-side/event-catalog-design\">事件目录与 Schema 设计</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Webhook 安全是分层防御体系：HMAC-SHA256 签名验证发送方身份，时间戳窗口防止重放攻击，常量时间比较防御时序侧信道，secret 轮换限制密钥泄露的影响范围。Standard Webhooks 规范将这些最佳实践固化为三个 HTTP 头的简洁协议，已被 100+ SaaS 采纳。IETF SWT 草案为需要非对称验证的零信任场景提供了 JWT-based 替代方案。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Webhook 安全与签名验证","id":"webhook-安全与签名验证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"威胁模型","id":"威胁模型"},{"level":2,"text":"HMAC-SHA256 签名机制","id":"hmac-sha256-签名机制"},{"level":2,"text":"Standard Webhooks 签名规范","id":"standard-webhooks-签名规范"},{"level":3,"text":"验证流程（Node.js 实现）","id":"验证流程-node-js-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"时间戳验证与防重放","id":"时间戳验证与防重放"},{"level":2,"text":"常量时间比较","id":"常量时间比较"},{"level":2,"text":"Secret 管理与轮换","id":"secret-管理与轮换"},{"level":2,"text":"IETF Secure Webhook Token（SWT）草案","id":"ietf-secure-webhook-token-swt-草案"},{"level":2,"text":"端点验证（Abuse Protection）","id":"端点验证-abuse-protection"},{"level":2,"text":"传输层安全最佳实践","id":"传输层安全最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"投递保证与重试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/fundamentals/delivery-guarantee-retry"},"next":{"title":"事件目录与 Schema 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-webhooks-callbacks/provider-side/event-catalog-design"}}